
$ ! LIST.COM - the govax Phase 29 probe (docs/PHASE-29.md, subtask 1).
$ !
$ ! 1. Listings: each source with MACRO/LIST, and LCTL, BINARY, SYMTAB,
$ !    and XREF again with /SHOW=, /NOSHOW=, /NOOBJECT, and
$ !    /CROSS_REFERENCE. The error sources'objects (if MACRO writes any)
$ !    and $STATUS show what an assembly with errors leaves behind.
$ ! 2. Traceback and debugger records: TRACE assembled with each /DEBUG,
$ !    /ENABLE, and /DISABLE choice, and DBGSRC with its own .ENABLE and
$ !    .DISABLE; ANALYZE/OBJECT of every object.
$ ! 3. Images: TRACE linked with and without traceback and with /DEBUG
$ !    (not run: it would start the debugger), with maps and
$ !    ANALYZE/IMAGE; and the failing programs, linked with and without
$ !    traceback and run, so the log keeps what VMS's traceback printed.
$ !
$ ! Run it with the volume holding the sources as the default directory,
$ ! keeping a log of everything it prints:
$ !
$ !     @LIST/OUTPUT=LIST.LOG
$ !
$ SET NOON
$ SET VERIFY
$ !
$ ! 1. Listings.
$ !
